    "description": "\ud83d\udcf1\ud83d\udca3 Cracked Screen with Time Bomb - The broken phone prank app that simulates a timed bomb explosion on the screen most realistically! \ud83d\ude31\r\n\r\nDo you want to play a fun and hilarious prank with your friends or family? The broken screen prank app is exactly what you're looking for! With the exploding screen feature and an image of a fake bomb, you can make everyone around you jump and burst into laughter. \r\n\r\nEnjoy screen time bomb now and get ready to pull off the ultimate prank that will have everyone talking! This wallpaper of broken screen app is designed to deliver maximum laughs and harmless fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca3 Time Bomb\r\n- Select the bomb you want\r\n- Set a countdown timer. \r\n- When the timer ends, the screen will explode and be broken. Just like a real explosion, making it almost impossible to distinguish between real or fake damage when not touching the screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude31 Realistic Broken Screen Effect\r\n- Fool your friends with a convincing shattered screen that looks like a disaster\r\n- Many styles of cracked screen, various broken screen effects\r\n- Apply for home or lock screen with hd broken screen affect\r\n- Realistic crack wallpaper and breaking glass sound.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude31 Electric Screen:\r\n- Set time to turn off effects\r\n- Electric screen styles: blue, yellow, white, green, red...\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude31 Taser Gun:\r\n- Preview the gun\r\n- Various taser gun: purple, green, red, yellow...\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Easy to Use: \r\nThe cracked screen effect app has a simple and user-friendly interface. You can easily create funny situations and share laughter with your friends. \r\n\r\nThis cracked screen prank app is a fantastic entertainment app to relax. It simulates the broken screen effect to play with your friends. It will not harm your mobile phone. Destroy your phone screen by other effects such as fire screen and electric screen.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on the opportunity to experience the app. Enjoy the broken screen prank now to make your phone look amazing and prank your friends.\r\n\r\nThe time bombs broken app is continually improving and being updated. Therefore, your feedback is highly valuable to our app development team. Sincerely thanks for using the realistic broken screen app.\r\n\r\nHave a nice day!",
